he storyline would  definitely make it more personal to sam  but the biggest takeaway at this point  is it seems like sam  isn't using the shield which of course  we'll go on to find out but  perhaps maybe sam chose to not use the  shield  maybe because of these experiments that  were conducted in the past he may have  fear or he may simply just not want to  because of the past  we then go to a convoy of vehicles in  which we have no idea who's inside but  we do know that seemingly this terrorist  organization that is introduced in this  trailer is going to eventually attack  them  as we go through the next couple of  scenes we hear the words from  bucky saying the world is upside down  and as we hear this we see  a very very big scene we see the falcon  the winter soldier and  zemo in a new city which we assume to be  madrapore now this is really huge  because if this is indeed  magipore it has a huge connection to not  only the x-men and mutants but to  wolverine specifically and  viper now in the comics viper is the  ruler of madrapore  viper would eventually take on the name  madame hydra  being a part of hydra's inner circle now  viper has tried to achieve  world domination a few times but has  usually been defeated by captain america  in which in this case now in the mcu  would technically according to steve  rogers be sam  which would explain why they are in  madrapore they are looking for viper  because she may  be behind all the terrorist attacks that  we see in this trailer  but viper is also very notably known for  marrying  logan the wolverine as i mentioned  magipore has a very big connection to  the x-men and specifically wolverine so  this  could very well be the introduction to  the mutants in the mcu but very  specifically  wolverine there have been a lot of  rumors in the past especially concerning  wolverine and his introduction in the  falcon and the winter soldier  so we'll just have to wait and see on  that now bucky and sam  are with zemo you 